{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object found, move to and take it, check properties. Else scan area, move to new object. Finally, complete task. list of available nodes: <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectWithinReach    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Sequence>     <Action ID = ScanArea    />     <Condition ID = IsNewObjectDetected    />     <Action ID = MoveToNewObject    /> </Sequence> <Action ID = CompleteTask    />",
    "BT": {
